00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.990
Second, you can take
advantage of a bunch

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:41.300
of other integrations that
Cloud Source Repositories

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:44.150
has with other GCP services.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.870
For example, Cloud
Pub/Sub, Cloud Build,

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:48.350
and Stackdriver Debugger.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.040
And we'll also demo
all of those later.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:55.370
Alternatively, you can choose to
